# ml/data holds several gigabytes of downloaded images and the split copied
# from them - all reproducible with `python prepare.py`, none of it belonging
# in a repository. What actually ships is the exported model and metadata under
# web/public/model, which ARE committed.
ml/data/
ml/artifacts/
ml/*.log

